1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:03,353
(Penny:)to spend your birthday
in a bathroom,

2
00:00:03,352 --> 00:00:06,482
(Penny:)I'm happy to do it with you.

3
00:00:08,157 --> 00:00:10,387
(Sheldon:)Well, everyone will
think I'm weird.

4
00:00:17,266 --> 00:00:19,596
(Penny:)Sweetie, you are weird.

5
00:00:20,903 --> 00:00:22,803
(Penny:)Everyone knows you're weird,

6
00:00:22,805 --> 00:00:24,075
(Penny:)but they're all still here

7
00:00:24,073 --> 00:00:26,643
(Penny:)because they care
about you so much.

8
00:00:26,642 --> 00:00:27,842
(Penny:)(knocking)

9
00:00:27,843 --> 00:00:28,943
KRIPKE:
Hello.

10
00:00:28,944 --> 00:00:30,374
(Barry(knocking):)Some of us need
to check our hair

11
00:00:30,379 --> 00:00:33,349
(Barry(knocking):)because we might have a shot
with Leonard's mother.

12
00:00:36,652 --> 00:00:38,582
(Scene:)Leonard.
Hey.

13
00:00:38,587 --> 00:00:39,857
(Leslie:)It's been a while.

14
00:00:39,855 --> 00:00:40,985
(Leonard:)Leslie.

15
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,620
(Leonard:)I can't remember
the last time we talked.

16
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:44,355
(Leonard:)So much has changed.

17
00:00:45,995 --> 00:00:48,325
(Leslie:)Has it?

18
00:00:49,798 --> 00:00:51,728
(Leonard:)Yeah, uh, um,
Penny and I got married.

19
00:00:51,734 --> 00:00:53,164
(Leslie:)Wow, congratulations.

20
00:00:53,168 --> 00:00:54,438
(Leslie:)You know, actually,

21
00:00:54,436 --> 00:00:56,206
(Leslie:)I thought you'd be living
with Sheldon forever.

22
00:00:56,205 --> 00:00:58,135
(Leonard:)Yeah, well...

23
00:00:59,908 --> 00:01:02,018
(Leonard:)Don't be a stranger.

